	"evidence": [
		"Run harvest1, build 24464547: giving one harvestable each name of its Woodcutting Items, Mining Items and Foraging EXP Items lists as its Custom Preset Name and calling Check Player Level set the level and the level to check listed here.",
		"Run harvest1, build 24464547: in The Elderglen Woods, Check Player Level set the same values on 422 placed harvestables, whatever level their placement recorded, and with every gathering level at 1 it refused Iron, Birch and Beetle and allowed Coal, Pine and Fly Agaric.",
		"Code: Check Player Level calls Set Required Level WOODCUTTING ITEMS, MINING ITEMS and FORAGING ITEMS, which write Required level, so the level a placement records is not the one the game checks.",
